      "content": "yeah but it's not just being overwhelmed. it's like... there's no exit. every time i think i'm catching a breath, something else just piles on. i look at my kid or my house and i just feel this intense urge to just... not be here. not in a way that sounds scary, just to stop the noise. to just have some silence. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just stop everything. does that make sense? it feels like the only way to find any control again.",
